    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5305" root="جذب" body-key="j">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجاذبوا الثَّوْبَ </span></b>  <i>They contended together in
pulling the garment,</i> or <i>piece of cloth.</i> (A.)
[Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara"> تجاذبوا أَطْرَافَ الكَلَامِ </span> (tropical:)  [<i>They contended
together in discourse, talk,</i> or <i>conversation</i>]. (A.)
See also 3. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And see 7.

